<title>GERMANY: Henkel says Q1 pre-tax profit up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Henkel says Q1 pre-tax profit up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31:</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     196     up 7 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4,708   vs 3,927</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of German chemicals and consumer products group is Henkel KGaA. The group also said it was optimistic that the positive developments seen in the first quarter would continue during the year.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
